<title>LEBANON: Beirut port workers to stage a one-day strike.</title>
<headline>Beirut port workers to stage a one-day strike.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beirut port workers will stage a one-day strike on Thursday to force the government to meet their pay demands, a statement by the workers' union said.</p>
<p>In the statement, published in Beirut newspapers on Wednesday, workers demanded a 20 percent salary increase and the cancellation of two articles of a new draft pay scale denying them some pay benefits.</p>
<p>It will be the first strike staged this year by the 2,500 workers at Beirut port -- the country's main import-export gateway.</p>
</text>
